# 0.1.21, a tester's crash (0.1.19 PC, US disc): "pocket gadgetron thing you buy from quark crashed game". Their log: the
# PDA (item 32) picked in the right hand with Akimbo's gun in the left (item 15), the right trigger pulled: "[vr-feel]
# the PDA's vendor opens", "[vr-shop] on foot at the vendor", then the game read 0x43A04293 (a float, not an address) in
# the vendor's update. The cause: the game keeps the item's press a few ticks, and the shop on foot runs the hero's code
# inside the vendor's update, which opened the vendor again there and emptied its menu. Here the same (QUEST_SIM_GIVE=
# 15,32 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=32 QUEST_SIM_LEFT=15 on Novalis, and the PDA alone): "[vr-shop] the game asked the vendor open
# again (the PDA's) while it is open on foot: refused", the screens up, another pull on them, the click closes it,
# "[vr-shop] left the vendor where he stands", no crash.
